; The frontend's per-session router is a boot-library module; its suite
; links the library exactly as test_serve_mount does. The composition is
; staged for real over a hermetic temp home, and the one process-shaped
; effect — the broker's spawn — is refused loudly through MENTAT_BIN, so
; every start decision is visible without a process.

